    "body": "<html>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sSJ5PgUx0Zg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sSJ5PgUx0Zg</a></p>\n<p>When it comes to fireworks, the bigger and the harder the better. Firework planners in Glasgow (Scotland) were stuck with a rather perplexing problem.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>They weren't sure how to end their fireworks display. After the usual wheels and firecrackers, the saucy pyrotechnic wizards apparently opted for an X-rated bang that the audience would remember.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>By the looks of it, the Glasgow residents loved every second of it.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Your move, Gandalf.&nbsp;</p>\n</html>",
