    "body": "Hello Everyone.\n\ni'm not sure i can do a long introduction like everybody else did , but i'll make a short one that has as many info about me as possible. \nFirst of all i'd like to thank my friend for suggesting steemit to me  and his girlfriend Katia , at first i thought it's just another reddit wannabe but once i registered , i pretty much like every ounce of the this, this is definitely different and i look forward to see this community & idea hit all the world. \n\nAnyways here's a summary about myself :\n\nMy name is Gandef ( not Gandalf hehe ) and i'm 22 Years old from Algeria , i'm a student at university , electronics field , i like Watching Shows & Movies ( My favourite show is Game Of thrones i just can't get enough of it ).\nI watch animes too , other than watching i do sport & really any activity that doesn't require a lot of time. \n\ni'm not sure i covered up everything about me but this is it for now , i'll make sure to edit once in a while my intro to add a bit of details. \n\nThank you for having me.",
